# shiroikuma-termux-gui fork: release signing credentials.
#
# The real keystore.properties is GITIGNORED — it carries the signing password in plaintext.
# Copy this file to keystore.properties and fill in the values to produce a signed release APK.
# Without it the `buildFork` task refuses to run (the release APK would come out UNSIGNED and
# would not install over the existing app).
#
# HARD RULE: this app shares Android UID `com.termux` with Termux, Termux:API, Termux:X11 and
# 白い熊 GNU Emacs, and Android requires every member of a shared UID to be signed with the SAME
# key. The whole family is therefore signed with ONE keystore,
#   ~/.android-keystores/shiroikuma-emacs-termux.jks   (PKCS12; the key alias contains a space)
# — any other key makes the install fail with INSTALL_FAILED_SHARED_USER_INCOMPATIBLE. Its
# password is recorded in
#   ~/〇/[666] 私資料/[666][27] 暗号/android-keystores.org
# with a backup copy of the .jks in the android-keystores/ directory next to that file.

storeFile=/home/shiroikuma/.android-keystores/shiroikuma-emacs-termux.jks
storePassword=
keyAlias=Emacs keystore
keyPassword=
